sequenceDiagram
  Caller ->> App : POST lane-runs with lane and sha
  alt seat credential
    App -->> Caller : 403, nothing cloned
  else sha not 40 hex, lane not declared, external lane, image not allowlisted
    App -->> Caller : 400 naming the rule, no runId
  else every worker busy
    App -->> Caller : 429 naming the limit
  else accepted
    App -->> Caller : 202 with runId, status running
    App ->> Git : clone the project's own source, checkout the exact sha
    App ->> Launcher : post lane job, network none, allowlisted digest, command verbatim
    Launcher ->> Job : start container with checkout at /w
    Job -->> Launcher : exit code
    App ->> Launcher : poll every 2 s until terminal
    alt start-unknown, or a cancel whose custody is kept
      App ->> App : skip DELETE on purpose, job not confirmed gone
    else completed, failed, timed out, or the poll failed
      App ->> Launcher : DELETE the job
      Launcher -->> App : confirmed gone (2xx or 404), or not confirmed
    end
    App ->> Store : write the receipt, with checkoutRetained when the job is not confirmed gone
    alt job confirmed gone
      App ->> App : remove the checkout
    else DELETE skipped, or attempted and not confirmed
      App ->> App : keep the checkout for a sweep not yet built
    end
  end
  Caller ->> App : GET lane-runs by runId or by sha
  App -->> Caller : the receipt, or none for a refused request
